<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow late Friday. Few sales of slaughter steers and heifers closed fully steady.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand were fair. Sales confirmed on 2,100 slaughter steers and 300 slaughter heifers. Last week's confirmed sales 118,200 head including 21,100 head or about 18 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1240 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1025 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>confirmed: 2400    Last week: 2200     Last Year: 4000</p>
</text>
